{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"updateGeoJSONSourceFeatures","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"forSourceId","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"sourceId"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"features","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.mapbox.MapboxMaps\/documentation\/MapboxMaps\/Feature","text":"Feature","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10MapboxMaps7Featurea"},{"text":"], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dataId","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil)"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["iOS"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"sourceId","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A style source identifier.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The GeoJSON features to be updated in the source.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"features"},{"name":"dataId","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An arbitrary string used to track the given GeoJSON data.","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The update operation will be scheduled and applied on a GeoJSON serialization queue.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In order to capture events when actual data is drawn on the map please refer to Events API","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and listen to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onSourceDataLoaded"},{"text":" (optionally pass the ","type":"text"},{"code":"dataId","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" parameter to